<title>HONG KONG: Century City interim net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Century City interim net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>	   (in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   18.9	 vs 6.7 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.2	  vs 2.1</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  259.7 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    387.5	vs 133.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,409.7    vs 1,529.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 Century City International</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 22-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 6</p>
<p>NOTE - Century City is a property development and investment firm.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain from disposals of certain share investments and investment properties.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted for the one-for-five bonus issue of shares allotted in June 1995.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
